1
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:36,900
I see...

2
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,930
I am the source of the power.

3
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,300
The more I resist,

4
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,600
the stronger it gets,

5
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,460
and the firmer the array becomes.

6
00:00:48,130 --> 00:00:49,900
Why give up?

7
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,100
If you had been this obedient earlier,

8
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:55,230
you wouldn't have suffered like this. Hahaha.

9
00:01:04,060 --> 00:01:05,120
What are you doing?

10
00:01:20,530 --> 00:01:21,060
Break!

11
00:01:39,630 --> 00:01:41,100
Protect the Emperor!

12
00:01:41,460 --> 00:01:44,600
What are you waiting for? Go and kill her!

13
00:01:50,130 --> 00:01:52,700
You go! Aren't you from the Vanguard Camp?

14
00:01:54,229 --> 00:01:55,700
You have a higher rank. You go first.

15
00:01:55,700 --> 00:01:57,800
Didn't you see all thirty-six Soul-Locking Pillars shattered?

16
00:01:57,800 --> 00:02:00,960
Going up there is just suicide. What can these few people do?

17
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:03,130
Useless! A bunch of useless fools!

18
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:05,030
What's the point of keeping you?

19
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:10,430
Ah!

20
00:02:10,759 --> 00:02:11,900
Kill!

21
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,600
Kill!

22
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:37,060
Li'er.

23
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,530
None of this was my intention.

24
00:02:39,530 --> 00:02:40,329
It was all her.

25
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,700
Qingyu instigated me.

26
00:02:42,030 --> 00:02:42,829
Your Majesty.

27
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,620
Li'er, you have to believe me.

28
00:02:44,860 --> 00:02:46,130
Extracting your divine bone three hundred years ago,

29
00:02:46,130 --> 00:02:47,900
it was her whispering slander in my ear,

30
00:02:47,900 --> 00:02:48,800
saying your achievements overshadowed mine,

31
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,960
and you would eventually usurp my throne.

32
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,900
Setting up the Soul-Refining Array was also her idea.

33
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:52,760
She was jealous of you

34
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:53,700
and wanted to destroy you.

35
00:02:53,700 --> 00:02:55,100
I was deceived by her.

36
00:02:58,230 --> 00:03:00,400
Hmph, I instigated it?

37
00:03:01,230 --> 00:03:02,030
Your Majesty.

38
00:03:02,100 --> 00:03:03,400
Who was it that held my hand in the middle of the night,

39
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,760
saying Bai Li was an eyesore,

40
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:06,400
and that she suffocated you?

41
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,060
Who said that as long as Bai Li was gone,

42
00:03:08,060 --> 00:03:09,860
no one in the Six Realms would dare defy you?

43
00:03:09,860 --> 00:03:10,960
Who promised me

44
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,200
that once Bai Li was completely eliminated,

45
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:13,230
I would become the Heavenly Empress?

46
00:03:13,230 --> 00:03:14,830
Shut up, you venomous woman!

47
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:23,860
Li'er, have you forgotten what we said

48
00:03:23,860 --> 00:03:25,530
in the Spirit Flower Sea back then?

49
00:03:25,530 --> 00:03:27,430
You said you would always stay by my side

50
00:03:27,430 --> 00:03:29,200
and help me secure the throne of the Heavenly Emperor.

51
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,760
We were to rule the Six Realms together,

52
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:32,220
lifetime after lifetime.

53
00:03:32,430 --> 00:03:34,030
Have you forgotten all this?

54
00:03:35,060 --> 00:03:37,300
Your so-called ruling the Six Realms together

55
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:39,030
was extracting my divine bone,

56
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:40,460
abandoning me in the Demon Realm,

57
00:03:40,460 --> 00:03:42,660
and leaving me to be devoured by demons.

58
00:03:43,130 --> 00:03:44,130
It's all Qingyu.

59
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,630
It's all her fault.

60
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:46,300
It's her.

61
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:48,760
I'll kill her right now to make amends to you.

62
00:03:55,100 --> 00:03:58,930
Your Majesty, you... you are truly ruthless.

63
00:04:04,030 --> 00:04:05,360
You are truly pathetic.

64
00:04:05,830 --> 00:04:07,230
After all your scheming,

65
00:04:07,300 --> 00:04:09,730
you're just a tool in someone else's hands,

66
00:04:09,730 --> 00:04:11,060
discarded when no longer useful.

67
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:11,900
Li'er, look.

68
00:04:11,930 --> 00:04:13,060
I killed her.

69
00:04:13,060 --> 00:04:14,630
The one who harmed you is dead.

70
00:04:14,630 --> 00:04:16,529
Let's wipe the slate clean, okay?

71
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:19,890
Come back. The position of Heavenly Empress is still yours.

72
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:24,030
Li'er.

73
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:24,900
No!

74
00:04:24,900 --> 00:04:26,030
God of War Bai Li,

75
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:27,560
I know I was wrong.

76
00:04:27,930 --> 00:04:29,530
I'll give you the throne of the Heavenly Emperor.

77
00:04:29,530 --> 00:04:30,700
I'll make amends to you.

78
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:32,260
Please spare my life, okay?

79
00:04:34,030 --> 00:04:36,630
Three hundred years ago, I begged you too.

80
00:04:40,630 --> 00:04:41,700
I ask you.

81
00:04:42,430 --> 00:04:45,360
Was our 300 years of affection all fake?

82
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,820
How did you answer me then?

83
00:04:55,930 --> 00:04:58,230
Now the tables have just turned.

84
00:04:58,900 --> 00:05:00,960
When you cast me into the Demon Realm,

85
00:05:01,230 --> 00:05:03,360
did you ever think this day would come?

86
00:05:03,860 --> 00:05:06,030
I was deceived by that bitch Qingyu.

87
00:05:06,030 --> 00:05:07,200
Baili, Baili,

88
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:07,960
let me go.

89
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:09,290
Give me one more chance.

90
00:05:09,430 --> 00:05:10,430
Ah!

91
00:05:11,130 --> 00:05:11,930
Ah!

92
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:18,230
What you owed me is paid in full today.

93
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,730
From now on,

94
00:05:20,060 --> 00:05:21,230
we are even.
